# f4-ej25: written by tools/cycles scenarios. Cycle table grid: holds at throttle 0.5.
# Each hold is 0.5 s of settling and at least 24 whole cycles; 0.25 s sweeps join the holds.
# The renderer reads cut RPM THROTTLE SECONDS as a hold with the ignition off. snarl does not read these files.
hold 830 0.5 4
sweep 830 1000 0.5 0.25
hold 1000 0.5 3.4
sweep 1000 1250 0.5 0.25
hold 1250 0.5 2.9
sweep 1250 1500 0.5 0.25
hold 1500 0.5 2.5
sweep 1500 1750 0.5 0.25
hold 1750 0.5 2.2
sweep 1750 2000 0.5 0.25
hold 2000 0.5 2
sweep 2000 2250 0.5 0.25
hold 2250 0.5 1.8
sweep 2250 2500 0.5 0.25
hold 2500 0.5 1.7
sweep 2500 2750 0.5 0.25
hold 2750 0.5 1.6
sweep 2750 3000 0.5 0.25
hold 3000 0.5 1.5
sweep 3000 3250 0.5 0.25
hold 3250 0.5 1.5
sweep 3250 3500 0.5 0.25
hold 3500 0.5 1.5
sweep 3500 3750 0.5 0.25
hold 3750 0.5 1.5
sweep 3750 4000 0.5 0.25
hold 4000 0.5 1.5
sweep 4000 4250 0.5 0.25
hold 4250 0.5 1.5
sweep 4250 4500 0.5 0.25
hold 4500 0.5 1.5
sweep 4500 4750 0.5 0.25
hold 4750 0.5 1.5
sweep 4750 5000 0.5 0.25
hold 5000 0.5 1.5
sweep 5000 5250 0.5 0.25
hold 5250 0.5 1.5
sweep 5250 5500 0.5 0.25
hold 5500 0.5 1.5
sweep 5500 5750 0.5 0.25
hold 5750 0.5 1.5
sweep 5750 6000 0.5 0.25
